  "id": "enthusiasm",
  "term": "enthusiasm",
  "definition": "In this psychology context, enthusiasm refers to a strong, lasting positive orientation toward a core activity, marked by intrinsic enjoyment, seeing the activity as valuable, and sustained passion for doing it. It is more specific than broad work-related feelings such as job satisfaction or general engagement.",
